<title>USA: Daktronics Inc Q3 Feb 1 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Daktronics Inc Q3 Feb 1 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>BROOKINGS, S.D. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.02     loss	$ 0.16</p>
